<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Florida Buzz Reel review</title><style>body{max-width:980px;margin:40px auto;padding:20px;font:16px system-ui;color:#182a34}table{border-collapse:collapse;width:100%}td,th{padding:12px;text-align:left;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd}a{color:#00697b}.notice{padding:18px;background:#eef5f6}</style></head><body>
<h1>Florida Buzz Reel review</h1><p class="notice">Phase 1: approval records a review decision only. No video or social copy is published.</p>
<p>Generation: <strong><%= cfg.generation ? 'enabled' : 'disabled' %></strong>. Schedule: <%= cfg.schedules ? cfg.cron : 'disabled' %> (Eastern).</p>
<p>Charged or reserved: today $<%= totals.day.toFixed(4) %> · this week $<%= totals.week.toFixed(4) %> · this month $<%= totals.month.toFixed(4) %>. Actual confirmed charges: $<%= totals.actual.toFixed(4) %>. Requests awaiting reconciliation: <%= totals.pending %>.</p>
<table><thead><tr><th>Topic</th><th>Status</th><th>Actual fal cost</th></tr></thead><tbody><% for(const pkg of packages) { %><tr><td><a href="/admin/reels/<%= pkg.id %>"><%= pkg.data.guide?.title || pkg.topic_key %></a></td><td><%= pkg.status %><% if(pkg.data.warning){ %><p><%= pkg.data.warning %></p><% } %></td><td><%= pkg.data.actualCost === undefined ? 'Pending' : '$'+pkg.data.actualCost.toFixed(4) %></td></tr><% } %></tbody></table>
</body></html>
